{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a297317a9da31dec95528394416ad335486bd17f8a4df4c30053ded61d2baf27", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影が無事に\n終わり、エレナが嬉しそうに駆け寄ってきた）", "zh": "（写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的拍摄顺利结束，艾琳娜开心地跑了过来）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "a312dd10e5a4d6718a5b41ee4b79e372b44b23d52ee70690ca7275017704eb93", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまだヨ～。\n今の、どうだった？　ワタシ、かわいく撮れてたかナ？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦～  \n刚才拍得怎么样？我拍得可不可爱呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c80b0b9075fcdacda5eddf7466ba6760f27a75112fe52f67ad602259439aa5d8", "ja": "ああ、良かったよ。エレナらしい、\n明るくてかわいいグラビアになりそうだ。", "zh": "嗯，很不错。应该会成为很有艾丽娜风格、开朗又可爱的写真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1003_p", "source_sha256": "daa6be1cd809e248b0a5ab5fcdef72113c4688b83b2e5e27fe2c582f98a81abe", "ja": "エレナがすごく楽しそうだったから、いい写真が\nたくさん撮れたって、スタッフさん達も言ってたよ。", "zh": "工作人员也说，因为艾蕾娜看起来特别开心，所以拍出了很多很棒的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "beeb58b84c85dded083967f2cf8a5d6fcda68bc3a62ae201cacf4b0c86df807a", "ja": "ホント？　よかった！　だってワタシ、\n今日の撮影、ホントに楽しかったんだヨ♪", "zh": "真的？太好了！因为我今天的拍摄真的特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "a213e62e7786dc6baf753870424397972a34199cdfc9940c4ce92cb55bd754c2", "ja": "スタジオじゃなくて学校で撮影だから、なんだか\nいつもと雰囲気が違って、ワクワクしたし……。", "zh": "因为不是在摄影棚，而是在学校拍摄，总觉得氛围和往常不一样，让人兴奋不已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "db40783c85b74b6900ee3e2bbdd9a80a498b2daf92243fe3c8dfd5e3c1823186", "ja": "それに、みんなとおそろいの制服がかわいくて\nハッピーな気分になれたんだヨ～。エヘヘ！", "zh": "而且，和大家穿着一样的制服特别可爱，让我心情也变得超开心～。嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a540bc084faf328c7f74181ab6b7d117067ed16984992ee80f1a440b57da01f9", "ja": "その制服、そんなに気に入ったのか？\nじゃあ青羽さんにも、感想を伝えないとな！", "zh": "你就那么喜欢那套制服啊？那也得把你的感想告诉青羽小姐才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "31cb5944069042ae54ae896e3afbc1f4283cab53c08ea1cb5bf0f5bd41b1fc08", "ja": "うん！　あとでミサキに感想言っておくネ♪\nそれに、学校で撮影できたのもうれしかったナ。", "zh": "嗯！之后我会跟美咲说说感想的♪  \n而且，能在学校拍摄也让我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "ed05c6c4a82579e74bd17616e3fb0805c005dddd577a0c1c445de4ae47057517", "ja": "ワタシ、学校って大好き！\nあとは友達と一緒なら、もっと楽しかったケド……。", "zh": "我最喜欢学校了！要是还能和朋友一起的话，就更开心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6af147f70e2bb428762cfe99d0eea71f11fa652311dba6580d8a9f7f328e7efa", "ja": "そうか。エレナはアイドル活動だけじゃなくて、\n普段の学校生活も楽しんでるんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。艾蕾娜不仅享受偶像活动，平时的校园生活也过得很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "4790b3e23fff65f9098986945ea7f2ba8e9b19eacd28485124d160e8dc807164", "ja": "エヘヘ、そうカモ！\n765プロが、学校だったらよかったナ～？", "zh": "嘿嘿，说不定呢！要是765事务所是学校就好了呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "5333029d15a9b9abff67029d87c6430d7d3700cbae9d1fa9322958c62968bd5c", "ja": "そしたらみんなや{$P$}と、\nお仕事だけじゃなくて、いつも一緒にいられるのにネ♪", "zh": "那样的话，就能和大家、{$P$}，不光是工作，平时也一直待在一起了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "8fa901a6e834e0f9eacee49b6d1633df25f037b890bb1e12ae830448ae86f830", "ja": "朝も一緒に登校して、授業を受けて……\nお昼ごはんも、一緒に食べるんだヨ！　楽しいでしょ？", "zh": "早上一起上学，一起上课……\n午饭也要一起吃哦！很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1014_p", "source_sha256": "277c1cceb03c07f1939b16aad3a251172b2e54eef0f9c115a47643a50648ca34", "ja": "アイドル全員が生徒の学校か。\n先生は大変そうだな……。", "zh": "全体偶像都是学生的学校吗？当老师可真够辛苦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "f7c7b0853f2821f17d74115b1726a9faef2709d1535df298de875c52e7b25644", "ja": "え～、絶対楽しいヨ～！\nあ、でも{$P$}は年上だから……。", "zh": "诶～，肯定会很开心的啦～！\n啊，不过{$P$}比我年长，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "3d8e853be26f115f21e1b4e7846a052f0737e1285523baf37f8d6b1adff82343", "ja": "ワタシとはクラスメイトじゃなくて、\n「センパイ」って感じかもだネ♪", "zh": "和我不是同班同学，而是那种“前辈”的感觉呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4e071a04031cc4de4caf103eb03751c40ff4610b0d32fae1ebb1b1cf791b580c", "ja": "そこは先生じゃないのか……。でも先輩だと\n教室が違うし、話す機会が少ないかもしれないな。", "zh": "那不该是老师吗……不过，要是前辈的话，教室又不一样，见面说话的机会可能会变少呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "3c9c84f7a67a001db95c6d05c904d7df12781c4b9baee79e29e33c083129ef8f", "ja": "そんなことないヨ～！　休み時間になったらワタシ、\n{$P$}の教室までいくからネ！", "zh": "才不是那回事呢～！一到休息时间，我就会去{$P$}的教室哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0153_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "5000614e54d2a68ba11135358b60a84aabc0271944c0fbe7e680af008b70d6bb", "ja": "だから、たくさんお話しようネ？　待っててネ、\n{$P$}センパイ♪　エヘヘ♪", "zh": "所以，我们要聊很多很多哦？等着我，\n{$P$}前辈♪　嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
